WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Eighteen thousand in total

2
00:00:10,790 --> 00:00:12,390
This Pihua Pavilion placed in space

3
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:13,990
It happens to be the same model sold here.

4
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:15,670
Now it has passed the list

5
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:20,910
You actually bought a boat

6
00:00:21,690 --> 00:00:23,130
Really good money

7
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:26,800
My parents said that having a boat will make it easier to go out in the future.

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,680
I have relatives living in the neighborhood next door

9
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:29,800
Just go and have a look

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,480
You guys go back first. You don’t have to wait for me.

11
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:34,080
It's getting dark. Just be safe and come back early.

12
00:00:41,190 --> 00:00:43,230
Go to the hospital and collect supplies.

13
00:00:48,910 --> 00:00:51,190
It looks like the second wave of heavy rain is coming

14
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:53,190
I have to hurry up
